<title>USA: US Treasuries lower, unbudged after Atlanta index.</title>
<headline>US Treasuries lower, unbudged after Atlanta index.</headline>
<text>
<p>*US Treasuries lower, unbudged after June Atlanta Fed index.</p>
<p>*Atlanta Fed manufacturing index 17.5 in June vs 17.3 May.</p>
<p>*Atlanta Fed prices paid index 8.7 in June vs 11.0 in May.</p>
<p>*Early profit-taking pushes prices moderately lower.</p>
<p>*Market focused on retail sales, CPI data due later in week.</p>
</text>
